# OpenVoiceCS-Bench provider credentials
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in only the providers you intend to score:
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# `.env` is gitignored and is loaded by `load_workspace_env()` before any
# provider call. Never commit real keys, and never paste them into scenario
# files, reports, or issue threads. Keys are read from the process environment
# first, so exporting them in your shell works too.
#
# No key is needed for `--agent oracle`, `--agent noop`, the reference
# fixtures, or any of the `validate-*` / `verify-release` commands. Those run
# fully offline.

# --- OpenAI-compatible aggregator (used by the top-50 sweep script) ---------
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# --- Direct provider APIs ---------------------------------------------------
OPENAI_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_API_KEY=
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
MINIMAX_API_KEY=
MOONSHOT_API_KEY=
DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=
XAI_API_KEY=

# Accepted aliases, if you already use these names elsewhere:
#   GOOGLE_API_KEY      <- GEMINI_API_KEY
#   MOONSHOT_API_KEY    <- KIMI_API_KEY
#   DASHSCOPE_API_KEY   <- ALIBABA_API_KEY, ALIBABA_CLOUD_API_KEY
#   OPENROUTER_API_KEY  <- OPENROUTER_KEY, OPEN_ROUTER_API_KEY
